That is weird! It looks like you already added your example to a relevant issue report.
https://github.com/hadley/ggplot2/issues/943

This error and loss of the legend appears to be triggered when your fill or color are mapped to a variable that takes only one value for certain values. I was able to trigger this with integers as low as 23 or non integers (e.g. 1.5, 6.5 and (1:50) + 0.1).
Perhaps a ggplot2 guru can help track this down.
-Allan

